    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple fighting game distilling the core essence of 3D fighting games! And yet, it's 2D...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distilling the essence of 3D fighting games, 2Deez is the perfect starting point, or grinding point, for someone who really wants to understand 3D fighting games as a subgenre.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story mode with 10 chapters, featuring characters such as a cursed rat, a cotton candy monster, and a cabal of evil wizards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own custom palette... with <strong><u>HATS!!!1!!1</u></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline Play with Bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline Versus Mode for local play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online lobby play with Rollback Netcode, chat, and spectators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replays to watch the games you've played, with replay takeover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-Game command list with frame data</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in-depth training mode with hitbox viewer, frame data display, a macro editor, and ability to save training macros to json files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you dig deep, and are willing to work with json files, the ability to make and fight against your own bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...A Discord server! Find the link on the DON!DON!GAME Youtube channel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple fighting game distilling the core essence of 3D fighting games! And yet, it's 2D...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distilling the essence of 3D fighting games, 2Deez is the perfect starting point, or grinding point, for someone who really wants to understand 3D fighting games as a subgenre.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story mode with 10 chapters, featuring characters such as a cursed rat, a cotton candy monster, and a cabal of evil wizards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own custom palette... with <strong><u>HATS!!!1!!1</u></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline Play with Bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline Versus Mode for local play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online lobby play with Rollback Netcode, chat, and spectators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replays to watch the games you've played, with replay takeover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-Game command list with frame data</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in-depth training mode with hitbox viewer, frame data display, a macro editor, and ability to save training macros to json files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you dig deep, and are willing to work with json files, the ability to make and fight against your own bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...A Discord server! Find the link on the DON!DON!GAME Youtube channel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A simple fighting game distilling the core essence of 3D fighting games! And yet, it's 2D...? Fight through a story mode featuring a cursed rat, a cotton candy monster, and evil wizards. Customise your characters with HATS!!!1!!1 and play against your friends in online lobbies with Rollback Netcode!",
